    "seo": "Centrally located near Grand Central Station, this hotel offers clean, efficient rooms and great value. Features include a rooftop bar with stunning views, a restaurant, and entertainment options. Compact rooms maximize space, while the vibrant common areas and prime location make it ideal for exploring NYC.",
    "image": "",
    "images": [],
    "about": "CHROMA EXY THE HOTEL CHROMA EXY is a part of hotel chain Chroma Italy Hotels since January 2013, characterized by all distinctive signs of CHROMA brand loved by our guests. Chroma Exy is located in the capital's center near Castro Pretorio metro station and only 500 meters from Termini station, arrival's point of the main links in Rome; it's located at the fifth floor in a building of the year '40 and has 5 bedrooms with the following types : 1 double room of 17 sqm 1 quadruple room of 26 sqm 1 triple room of 20 sqm 1 suite room of 25 sq m Whose names, taken from the colors that represent Chroma brand, are: Ruby fountain and Purple infusion are able to accomodate until 4 people; Silver Mountain and Torquais Paradise suitable for honey moon; Gold imperial able to accommodate until 3 people. Chroma Exy will be glad to accommodate you in the suites created with taste and modern style, suitable for small families, groups of friends and couples on their honeymoon. You will be welcome by Andrea and Emanuele, always ready to explain everything that one can offer of this beautiful and wonderful city. They will recommend you the tours to the main monuments, coolest restaurants where to stop and eat typical Roman food; after a busy and tiring day strolling the city, you can enjoy a nice shower with chromotherapy to relax. All the rooms have Italian bathroom, XL chromoterapy shower, set of free toiletries, air conditioning and always clean linen. It is a mini fridge to keep your drinks fresh and kettles for tea lovers. Free wi-fi throughout the hotel and flat-panel TVs 32\" is available in each rooms. At the check-in you will have the keys leaving you completely independent without any constraint of times, you will have a short description of the room, the tickets for the breakfast at our recommended Bar to enjoy a delicious Italian style breakfast, with croissants pastries. On request we can serve you breakfast in your room at no extra cost. You will receive a set of keys courtesy to leave your luggage at the check-out, in case of late departure. Our strengths are its central location, proximity to subway stations on line A and B, the unique style of the structure, the exemplary cleanliness and the friendliness and expertise put at your disposal by the staff, who speaks fluently Italian and English. Finally, least but not last, it is available a shuttle service upon your request. Staying at Chroma Exy is an experience that will surprise you. The staff is always attentive to the needs and questions of the customers. A pleasant and comforting stay at your Chroma Exy is our most important mission.",
