    "about": "Finding an ideal charming hotel in Paris does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Pavillon Opera Grands Boulevards, a nice option for travelers like you. Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Cathédrale Notre-Dame de Paris (1.5 mi) and Champs-Elysees (1.7 mi), guests of Pavillon Opera Grands Boulevards can easily experience some of Paris' most well known attractions. As your “home away from home,” the hotel rooms offer a flat screen TV, a minibar, and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available. Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage while staying at Pavillon Opera Grands Boulevards. In addition, Pavillon Opera Grands Boulevards offers breakfast buffet, which will help make your Paris trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is parking available to guests. If you’re looking for a steakhouse, consider a visit to Le Relais de l'Entrecote, Il Etait Un Square, or La Poule au Pot, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Pavillon Opera Grands Boulevards. During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Louvre Museum (1.0 mi), Musée d'Orsay (1.2 mi), and Montmartre (0.9 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel. Pavillon Opera Grands Boulevards looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Paris.",
